      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Colours"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Counting down and counting up each have their own colour, both green to begin with. Set them apart and a timer that runs past zero changes colour as it turns into a stopwatch. The middle and the interval band are shaded from your choice, so the palette offers only colours that stay legible shaded."
      },
      {
